# Spec §4.4, §5.5, §5.6, §5.7 and §6.1 (checkbox, Mostrar completadas).
# Completing a task with more than one window per day.
#   - Calendar and relative in days: the completion stores the occurrence it
#     covers as a date and time (the day at the from time of its window). If there are
#     uncovered occurrences starting in (P, now], it covers the most recent one
#     (the earlier ones are discarded); otherwise, N. On an overdue relative, it
#     covers the window with the most recent start <= now, of any day,
#     and the sequence continues from there.
#   - One-off: it is completed only once, in any of its windows.
#   - Checkbox: disabled outside the windows when it would complete;
#     always enabled when it would delete. After completing the morning, in the
#     afternoon window the task is pending (not completed) and tapping the
#     checkbox completes it; between windows it is completed and tapping it deletes
#     today's completion.
# Reference week: Monday 2026-07-13, Wednesday 15, Thursday 16, next
# Wednesday 22; previous Thursday 2026-07-09.
Feature: Complete with several schedules

  # Complete with several schedules 1
  # Calendar: which occurrence a completion covers. Row 1: in the morning,
  # it covers the morning. Row 2: with the morning missed, in the afternoon it covers the afternoon
  # (the morning is discarded). Row 3: with the morning covered, in the afternoon
  # it covers the afternoon.
  Scenario Outline: Complete with several schedules 1
    Given a weekly recurring task on <days>
    And the task has a completion from <previous> that covers <covered_previous>
    And the task can be completed from <from> to <to> and from <from2> to <to2>
    When I tap the task checkbox on <tap>
    Then the new completion is added without changing the previous ones
    And a completion was recorded that covers <covered>

    Examples:
      | days              | previous            | covered_previous    | from  | to    | from2  | to2    | tap                 | covered             |
      | miércoles, jueves | 2026-07-09T19:00:00 | 2026-07-09T18:00:00 | 07:00 | 10:00 | 18:00  | 21:00  | 2026-07-15T08:00:00 | 2026-07-15T07:00:00 |
      | miércoles, jueves | 2026-07-09T19:00:00 | 2026-07-09T18:00:00 | 07:00 | 10:00 | 18:00  | 21:00  | 2026-07-15T18:30:00 | 2026-07-15T18:00:00 |
      | miércoles, jueves | 2026-07-15T08:00:00 | 2026-07-15T07:00:00 | 07:00 | 10:00 | 18:00  | 21:00  | 2026-07-15T18:00:00 | 2026-07-15T18:00:00 |

